    <briefdescription>
<para>Zero-Heap LZ4 Raw Block Compression &amp; Decompression. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Implements standard LZ4 raw block format compression and decompression without dynamic memory allocation or complex framing overhead. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
